{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51031","headline":"闲居 · 延寿","name":"闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居谁似我，退迹理难过。\n要势危身早，浮荣败德多。\n雨催虫出穴，寒逼鸟移窼。\n野径无人翦，疏窗入薜萝。\n（见《宋诗纪事》卷九十一。\n）（张靖龙云此诗见《读画斋丛书》本《南宋羣贤小集》收陈起辑《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷中。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}